verify.py / humanoid.py mutations, 2026-09-10.

Each entry names the file and the exact text swapped, then the full unittest
output of `python3 -W ignore scripts/avatar/verify_test.py -v` under it. Restore
writes back the bytes read at the top of the run and asserts the file matches;
__pycache__ is cleared before and after every run, because CPython keys bytecode
by (mtime, size) and an equal-length mutation landing in the same second runs the
previous one.

